Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Now that we have all the diagrams, including the vertex expressions and the \
propagator expressions, we need to combine them into an amplitude expression. \
  We need to multiply all the expressions (vertex and propagator) and divide \
by an overall I.  Create a function that does this.   Then, we will improve \
it.\
\>", "ChatInput",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "ChatNotebookSettings" -> <|
    "Model" -> <|"Service" -> "LLMKit", "Name" -> Automatic|>, "LLMEvaluator" -> 
     "WolframAIAssistant", "ServiceCaller" -> "Chatbar"|>|>,
 CellLabel->
  "In[293]:=",ExpressionUUID->"79646f85-db3e-48e9-a8b2-0313012fa277"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "You can define a first-pass amplitude builder that just takes one decorated \
diagram, extracts all vertex factors and propagator factors, multiplies them \
together, and divides by an overall ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["I", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "I", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7cd0a6f2-3e14-4ab7-826e-5a230bc90d42"],
 ".\n\nHere is a simple version: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"diagramAmplitude", "[", "diag_", "]"}], ":=", 
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"vertexFactors", ",", "propagatorFactors"}], "}"}], ",",
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"vertexFactors", "=", 
                RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#", ",", "\"Expression\"", ",", "Nothing"}], 
                    "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"diag", "[", "\"VertexStructures\"", "]"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";", 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{"propagatorFactors", "=", 
                RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"diag", "[", "\"Propagators\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",",
                     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "\"Factor\"", ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "Nothing"}], 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";", 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Times", " ", "@@", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"vertexFactors", ",", "propagatorFactors"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "/", "I"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]], 
     "ChatCode", "Input", LanguageCategory -> "Input", ShowAutoStyles -> True,
      ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> True, 
     TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
         AbsoluteCurrentValue[$FrontEnd, {TranslationOptions, "Enabled"}]]}], 
    "Wolfram"},
   "ChatCodeBlockTemplate"]], "ChatCodeBlock",ExpressionUUID->
  "cd57687f-2724-4280-abeb-ef7cd4bd7b03"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"What it does\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"2fc96aca-a9eb-4c83-b649-0a07332f61c3"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "pulls all vertex expressions from ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell["diag[\"VertexStructures\"]", Background -> None]},
    "ChatCodeInlineTemplate"]], "ChatCodeActive",ExpressionUUID->
   "ffbbfb72-f231-4969-9bb3-26b1874c85fd"]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"ec1b95ea-cc99-41a3-b85a-5aabc3b8507a"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "pulls all propagator factors from ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell["diag[\"Propagators\"]", Background -> None]},
    "ChatCodeInlineTemplate"]], "ChatCodeActive",ExpressionUUID->
   "dbf82476-62e9-4b5d-a446-a36019a4096e"]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"fa4d1766-81b8-4f63-a5fa-c63462352926"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "multiplies them all together with ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   TemplateBox[{
    "Times", "paclet:ref/Times", 
     "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/Times.html"},
    "TextRefLink"]],ExpressionUUID->"d7805989-77de-49a3-aaf8-33af914952e0"]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"25ff1e20-ad88-46a1-a796-c7dd070730f2"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "divides by the overall ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   TemplateBox[{
    "I", "paclet:ref/I", "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/I.html"},
    
    "TextRefLink"]],ExpressionUUID->"1da08f43-c055-4b47-a226-c891d764ba93"]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"b2c32426-fce4-409a-ae03-78746d3e5c87"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Notes\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"129aad3b-7cb0-45f9-84bf-72f09cfc2152"],
 "\nRight now this includes ",
 StyleBox["all allowed vertex structure instances",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " at each vertex, since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell["diag[\"VertexStructures\"]", Background -> None]},
   "ChatCodeInlineTemplate"]], "ChatCodeActive",ExpressionUUID->
  "71b839e6-0163-4fc4-a7d3-09f383c41f99"],
 " stores lists of candidates per vertex. So this function effectively \
multiplies all of them together, which is probably ",
 StyleBox["not yet",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " what you ultimately want physically.\n\nA slightly safer version is to use \
just the first vertex structure at each vertex for now: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"diagramAmplitudeFirst", "[", "diag_", "]"}], ":=", 
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"vertexFactors", ",", "propagatorFactors"}], "}"}], ",",
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"vertexFactors", "=", 
                RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"First", " ", "/@", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"diag", "[", "\"VertexStructures\"", "]"}], 
                    "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    "\"Expression\"", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    "Nothing"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";", 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{"propagatorFactors", "=", 
                RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"diag", "[", "\"Propagators\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",",
                     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "\"Factor\"", ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "Nothing"}], 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";", 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Times", " ", "@@", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"vertexFactors", ",", "propagatorFactors"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "/", "I"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]], 
     "ChatCode", "Input", LanguageCategory -> "Input", ShowAutoStyles -> True,
      ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> True, 
     TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
         AbsoluteCurrentValue[$FrontEnd, {TranslationOptions, "Enabled"}]]}], 
    "Wolfram"},
   "ChatCodeBlockTemplate"]], "ChatCodeBlock",ExpressionUUID->
  "b564dde7-8444-4feb-9100-ca2da90d98ea"],
 "\nIf you want, the next step can be to make this return either:\n1. a ",
 StyleBox["single amplitude",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " using one chosen vertex structure per vertex, or\n2. the ",
 StyleBox["sum over all compatible vertex-structure combinations",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "."
}], "ChatOutput",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "CellToStringData" -> 
   "You can define a first-pass amplitude builder that just takes one \
decorated diagram, extracts all vertex factors and propagator factors, \
multiplies them together, and divides by an overall $$I$$.\n\nHere is a \
simple version:\n\n```wl\ndiagramAmplitude[diag_] := Module[\n  \
{vertexFactors, propagatorFactors},\n  \n  vertexFactors = Flatten[\n    \
Lookup[#, \"Expression\", Nothing] & /@ Values[diag[\"VertexStructures\"]]\n  \
];\n  \n  propagatorFactors = Lookup[\n    Values[diag[\"Propagators\"]], \n  \
  \"Factor\", \n    Nothing\n  ];\n  \n  Times @@ Join[vertexFactors, \
propagatorFactors] / I\n]\n```\n\n### What it does\n- pulls all vertex \
expressions from ``diag[\"VertexStructures\"]``\n- pulls all propagator \
factors from ``diag[\"Propagators\"]``\n- multiplies them all together with \
[Times](paclet:ref/Times)\n- divides by the overall ``I``\n\n### Notes\nRight \
now this includes **all allowed vertex structure instances** at each vertex, \
since ``diag[\"VertexStructures\"]`` stores lists of candidates per vertex. \
So this function effectively multiplies all of them together, which is \
probably **not yet** what you ultimately want physically.\n\nA slightly safer \
version is to use just the first vertex structure at each vertex for now:\n\n\
```wl\ndiagramAmplitudeFirst[diag_] := Module[\n  {vertexFactors, \
propagatorFactors},\n  \n  vertexFactors = Lookup[\n    First /@ Values[diag[\
\"VertexStructures\"]], \n    \"Expression\", \n    Nothing\n  ];\n  \n  \
propagatorFactors = Lookup[\n    Values[diag[\"Propagators\"]], \n    \
\"Factor\", \n    Nothing\n  ];\n  \n  Times @@ Join[vertexFactors, \
propagatorFactors] / I\n]\n```\n\nIf you want, the next step can be to make \
this return either:\n1. a **single amplitude** using one chosen vertex \
structure per vertex, or\n2. the **sum over all compatible vertex-structure \
combinations**.", "ChatData" -> 
